        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Tim O'Brien, Lavinia Greenlaw, Andrew Cowan, Kathryn Hughes, Val Taylor\n- Products: Going After Cacciato\n- Organizations: Delacorte Press, UEA Creative Writing Course\n- Roles: Course Directors\n\nFacts:\n- Tim O'Brien was born on October 1, 1946, and he is an American novelist.\n- Lavinia Greenlaw was born on 30 July 1962, and she is an English poet and novelist.\n- Going After Cacciato was written by Tim O'Brien and was first published by Delacorte Press in 1978.\n- Going After Cacciato is an anti-war novel.\n- The current Course Directors of the UEA Creative Writing Course are Andrew Cowan, Kathryn Hughes, Lavinia Greenlaw, and Val Taylor.",
